      "title": "The Chalkboard Sentence",
      "punchline": "\"The entire classroom laughed.\"",
      "caption": "The entire classroom laughed.\n\nDAY 01 OF 30 • ACT I: THE INNOCENT SPARK - The Chalkboard Sentence\n\nThe classroom hummed with pre-class energy, the teacher yet to arrive. Sid stepped up to the blackboard, eyes sparkling with daring mischief. Chalk in hand, he boldly scribbled: \"The world vanishes when my gaze is fixed on her. I see a beautiful world inside.\" He signed it with a heart as Isha blushed from her bench.\n\nThe English teacher walked in, surveyed the room, and picked up the chalk. With a knowing smile, she reworded it: \"The entire universe vanishes until nothing exists but her gaze, revealing a world trapped within.\" Capping the chalk, she declared, \"This looks better.\"\n\nThis is Day 01 of SIDISHA - Home Was You\nA 30-Day Drabble Collection by Nalkudil Studio\nOne memory. One spark. Every morning 10:15 AM IST.\n\n🔊 Sound on: Vaseegara (Flute Instrumental) Â· Bombay Jayashri / Harris Jayaraj\n\nRead with illustrations on blog - link in bio\nFree 30-Day Booklet: iamsaravofficial.com/book-club\n\nDid you ever have a blackboard or desk doodle dedicated to your school crush? Tell me below! 👇\n\n#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #90slovestory #nalkudilstudio",
      "hashtags": "#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #90slovestory #nalkudilstudio",
      "slide1_url": "assets/sid_isha/slide1/day_01.jpg",
      "slide1_filename": "SidIsha_Day_01_Slide1_Art.jpg",
      "slide2_url": "assets/sid_isha/slide2/day_01.jpg",
      "slide2_filename": "SidIsha_Day_01_Slide2_Story.jpg",
      "status": "PUBLISHED",
      "instagram_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfL5Rd7n68z/",
      "slide1_alt": "A warm, nostalgic photograph inside a sunlit 90s Indian classroom showing a charming high school boy in uniform writing playful romantic equations on a large green chalkboard while smiling shyly toward an off-camera classmate. A text overlay at the top reads \"The entire classroom laughed.\" alongside a circular author portrait badge in the lower right corner.",
      "slide2_alt": "A dark, vintage-framed micro-fiction reading slide titled \"The Chalkboard Sentence\" by author Saravanakumar Murugan, from the Sid and Isha 30-day Drabble series. The story narrates Sid stepping up to the blackboard before class begins to scribble a humorous sentence confessing his feelings for Isha, prompting laughter from the classroom while she hides behind her notebook. An illustrated footer banner displays \"SIDISHA: HOME WAS YOU\" featuring two school students with bicycles on an evening street."
