      "punchline": "\"You turned me on.\"",
      "caption": "You turned me on.\n\nDAY 02 OF 30 • ACT I: THE INNOCENT SPARK - The Chemistry & The Rain\n\nSid and Isha walked home, towing their cycles side-by-side. \"She glowed bright inside the dark room, much more than the stars,\" Sid said. \"I prayed I’d stay composed, but Einstein's theory can't be wrong. I can’t help.\" Isha smiled up at him. \"Neither can I, Sid. I had to glow. You turned me on.\"\n\nSuddenly, a gentle breeze rustled the leaves as the universe conspired, and drizzling rain began to fall. In no time, they were both drenched in the cold downpour. She looked more radiant than he'd ever imagined. Overcome, she leaned in and sealed his lips with hers.\n\nThis is Day 02 of SIDISHA - Home Was You\nA 30-Day Drabble Collection by Nalkudil Studio\nOne memory. One spark. Every morning 10:15 AM IST.\n\n🔊 Sound on: Munbe Vaa (Acoustic / Rain Lo-Fi) Â· A.R. Rahman / Shreya Ghoshal\n\nRead with illustrations on blog - link in bio\nFree 30-Day Booklet: iamsaravofficial.com/book-club\n\nHave you ever walked in the sudden monsoon rain with someone who made the storm feel warm? 👇\n\n#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #90slovestory #nalkudilstudio",
