      "caption": "Deliciously dangerous.\n\nDAY 03 OF 30 • ACT I: THE INNOCENT SPARK - Deliciously Dangerous\n\n\"Deliciously dangerous,\" Sid murmured, still tasting rain and breathless wonder. Isha tilted her head, clutching the handlebars tightly. \"Not as quiet as last time, but definitely becoming a trend.\" \"Should we avoid it?\" \"Too late,\" she whispered softly. \"We’re already etched into tonight’s history.\" A stray gust sent a gentle shiver through her wet uniform. Sid grinned.\n\n\"Maybe the universe simply wants us to linger in small moments.\" \"To become legends like Radha-Krishna?\" \"Nah… like Jodhaa-Akbar?\" Isha teased. Sid chuckled warmly. \"Whatever you wish, my sweetie pie. Love makes life beautiful.\" \"Sid and Isha make love sound beautiful,\" she whispered back.\n\nThis is Day 03 of SIDISHA - Home Was You\nA 30-Day Drabble Collection by Nalkudil Studio\nOne memory. One spark. Every morning 10:15 AM IST.\n\n🔊 Sound on: Pehla Nasha (Piano Instrumental) Â· Jatin-Lalit\n\nRead with illustrations on blog - link in bio\nFree 30-Day Booklet: iamsaravofficial.com/book-club\n\nWhat is the most 'deliciously dangerous' memory from your school days? 👇\n\n#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #90slovestory #nalkudilstudio",
