      "caption": "With you, my entire world finds perfect order.\n\nDAY 12 OF 30 • ACT II: THE GROWING FLAME & SECRET WORLD - Margin Notes\n\nDuring study hour, the library smelled of old paper and dust. Across the scarred wooden table, Isha slid her thick physics textbook toward Sid, tapping page ninety-four. Sid glanced down, expecting thermodynamics notes. Instead, penned into the narrow white margin in tiny cursive was: Focus on entropy, or focus on me?\n\nSid picked up his pen, heart hammering against his ribs. Below her neat handwriting, he inked: Second law of thermodynamics: entropy always increases. But with you, my entire world finds perfect order. He slid it back. Isha hid her burning blush behind the heavy cover, smiling endlessly.\n\nThis is Day 12 of SIDISHA - Home Was You\nA 30-Day Drabble Collection by Nalkudil Studio\nOne memory. One spark. Every morning 10:15 AM IST.\n\n🔊 Sound on: Zara Zara (Lo-Fi Beat) Â· Bombay Jayashri\n\nRead with illustrations on blog - link in bio\nFree 30-Day Booklet: iamsaravofficial.com/book-club\n\nDid you ever write secret margin notes in shared textbooks or notebooks? 👇\n\n#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #90slovestory #nalkudilstudio",
