      "caption": "One chai. Shared warmth.\n\nDAY 13 OF 30 • ACT II: THE GROWING FLAME & SECRET WORLD - Half a Cup of Chai\n\nThe roadside tea stall smelled of crushed cardamom and boiling milk. Tucked behind the wooden counter away from prying eyes, Sid balanced two glass tumblers. \"Drink quick before someone spots our uniforms,\" Isha urged, yet made no move to rush. Sid smiled, holding out a single steaming glass instead. \"One chai. Shared warmth.\"\n\nShe took a sip, hot ginger stinging her tongue sweetly, then passed it back. Their fingertips brushed, lingering just long enough to send heat prickling beneath their collars. \"Delicious,\" she murmured, watching him drink from the exact same rim. \"Deliciously ours,\" Sid corrected, grinning.\n\nThis is Day 13 of SIDISHA - Home Was You\nA 30-Day Drabble Collection by Nalkudil Studio\nOne memory. One spark. Every morning 10:15 AM IST.\n\n🔊 Sound on: Chaiyya Chaiyya (Acoustic Folk Flute) Â· A.R. Rahman\n\nRead with illustrations on blog - link in bio\nFree 30-Day Booklet: iamsaravofficial.com/book-club\n\nCutting chai shared between two: is there any luxury in the world that beats it? 👇\n\n#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #90slovestory #nalkudilstudio",
