      "caption": "Flattery won't save you, Sid.\n\nDAY 14 OF 30 • ACT II: THE GROWING FLAME & SECRET WORLD - The Junior’s Query\n\nOutside the staff room, a bright-eyed tenth grader asked Sid for physics guidance, giggling at his explanation. Around the corner, Isha leaned against a pillar, arms tightly folded. \"Very helpful of you, Mr. Tutor,\" she remarked as Sid walked up, her tone dripping with mock sweetness. \"She called your explanation cute.\" \"Did she?\"\n\n\"Purely academic duty,\" Sid teased, catching the sharp pout on her lips. Sid stepped closer into her shadow, murmuring softly, \"Too bad I only tutor one student in the art of being adorable.\" Isha fought a smile, rolling her eyes. \"Flattery won't save you, Sid.\"\n\nThis is Day 14 of SIDISHA - Home Was You\nA 30-Day Drabble Collection by Nalkudil Studio\nOne memory. One spark. Every morning 10:15 AM IST.\n\n🔊 Sound on: Urugi Urugi (Acoustic) Â· Sid Sriram\n\nRead with illustrations on blog - link in bio\nFree 30-Day Booklet: iamsaravofficial.com/book-club\n\nWho is the person whose teasing you secretly looked forward to every single day? 👇\n\n#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #90slovestory #nalkudilstudio",
