      "caption": "Property of Isha. Forever non-negotiable.\n\nDAY 21 OF 30 • ACT III: THE THRESHOLD & THE PROMISE - Ink on Cotton\n\nPermanent marker fumes hung thick over the school courtyard. Everyone was scribbling sloppy farewell jokes across white uniform shirts. Sid stood motionless as Isha stepped before him, pen uncapped. With steady, deliberate strokes, she pressed the marker against the fabric directly over his heart. Property of Isha, she wrote, looking up through damp lashes.\n\nForever non-negotiable. Sid took the marker from her trembling hand. Over the collar of her shirt, he inked four simple words: Always my glowing queen. Around them, classmates laughed and took photos, oblivious that two souls had just signed their lives away.\n\nThis is Day 21 of SIDISHA - Home Was You\nA 30-Day Drabble Collection by Nalkudil Studio\nOne memory. One spark. Every morning 10:15 AM IST.\n\n🔊 Sound on: Aariro (Acoustic Lullaby) Â· Santhosh Narayanan\n\nRead with illustrations on blog - link in bio\nFree 30-Day Booklet: iamsaravofficial.com/book-club\n\nDo you still have your farewell school uniform shirt signed with sketch pens? 👇\n\n#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #firstlove #nalkudilstudio",
