      "punchline": "\"Every frequency in my mind is tuned to you.\"",
      "caption": "Every frequency in my mind is tuned to you.\n\nDAY 23 OF 30 • ACT III: THE THRESHOLD & THE PROMISE - Terminal Goodbyes\n\nAutomated sliding doors hummed in the background at Departure Terminal 1. The digital boarding screen blinked mercilessly, counting down minutes they couldn't buy back. Isha clung to Sid’s jacket, her fingers knotting into the fabric. \"Don't let me forget the sound of your voice.\" \"Every frequency in my mind is tuned to you.\"\n\n\"Impossible,\" Sid murmured, burying his face in her hair, breathing in her scent like a man storing oxygen for a drought. The final call echoed overhead. With one desperate, breathless kiss, she pulled away, disappearing past security into an unmapped, solitary world.\n\nThis is Day 23 of SIDISHA - Home Was You\nA 30-Day Drabble Collection by Nalkudil Studio\nOne memory. One spark. Every morning 10:15 AM IST.\n\n🔊 Sound on: Poongatrile (Dil Se Flute Instrumental) Â· A.R. Rahman\n\nRead with illustrations on blog - link in bio\nFree 30-Day Booklet: iamsaravofficial.com/book-club\n\nTerminal goodbyes are the hardest. Have you ever stood at an airport gate wishing time would freeze? 👇\n\n#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #firstlove #nalkudilstudio",
